{
  "about": [
      "Fictional trials for src/sex_gender_analysis.py. No case is a registry record: the NCT ids are reserved fictional values and every measure was written for the case it names.",
      "Each case gives the API v2 baseline measures (as select_raw_measures retains them), the registered enrollment, and the expected lean block (src/sex_gender_analysis.lean_block) plus selected keys of the full block. The parser row is built with src/sex_gender_table.build_row, so the parser's own counts are checked by the vendored suite, not here.",
      "2026-10-28: after the owner's rule decisions only R-GC-05 is listed in `unresolved` (where gender categories were derived or excluded); R-IC-01, R-PO-01 and R-FS-01 are decided limitations stated on their fields."
  ],
